  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the claypot over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the diced red bell pepper and cook until tender",
    "Add the brown lentils, vegetable broth, tomato paste, and crushed tomatoes",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes",
    "Season the stew with salt and pepper to taste",
    "Toast the bread slices until crispy",
    "Serve the stew hot, topped with crispy bread slices"
